Yes, fdisk has been broken for many years. I believe it broke in v2.23.

See https://marc.info/?t=3D143891491000001&r=3D1&w=3D4

Use `parted` instead.

(parted) mktable bsd

See https://forums.gentoo.org/viewtopic-t-1025044.html for some instruction=
s.

